{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479820/extras/0a301baf32e6208cbb97f5f88786c454.avif?t=1771005937\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479820/extras_big/0a301baf32e6208cbb97f5f88786c454.avif?t=1771005937 width=800 height=209 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Terminal Outbreak</i></strong> is a fast paced speed game where you are constantly accelerating forward and can only slow down and move left and right to avoid the obstacle filled levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game thrives on simple controls but hard levels and is focused on players achieving the best times they can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as an Anti Virus on a mission to stop a Super Virus from infecting\u00a0computers worldwide. You will travel through\u00a0Nostalgic Worlds, Tricky  Levels, and Brutal Boss Fights in order to cleanse the internet of this Virus threat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479820/extras/5d10a4392fdd7031beb5eafe71832b84.avif?t=1771005937\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479820/extras_big/5d10a4392fdd7031beb5eafe71832b84.avif?t=1771005937 width=800 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ Levels of Fast Paced, Score Chasing, Speed Running Goodness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Computerized Worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Best Time Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nostalgic Early 2000's Internet Style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge Obstacles, Launch Into the Air, Teleport Across Levels and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environments that react and bounce to the Soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ Death Messages to announce your failures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minor Dating Sim Elements?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3479820?t=1771005937","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479820/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771005937","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479820/989320bceaedc07c7a602f4ab1b60d2124b3b390/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771005937","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479820/989320bceaedc07c7a602f4ab1b60d2124b3b390/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771005937","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4366050,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479820/extras/0a301baf32e6208cbb97f5f88786c454.avif?t=1771005937\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479820/extras_big/0a301baf32e6208cbb97f5f88786c454.avif?t=1771005937 width=800 height=209 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Terminal Outbreak</i></strong> is a fast paced speed game where you are constantly accelerating forward and can only slow down and move left and right to avoid the obstacle filled levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game thrives on simple controls but hard levels and is focused on players achieving the best times they can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as an Anti Virus on a mission to stop a Super Virus from infecting\u00a0computers worldwide. You will travel through\u00a0Nostalgic Worlds, Tricky  Levels, and Brutal Boss Fi